.git
# Docker matches a pattern without "**/" against the context root only (unlike .gitignore, which
# matches a slash-free pattern at any depth), so these are spelled with "**/" to reach every
# workspace package's own copy.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
packages/api/.svelte-kit
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
# The api build bundles the admin guide that `zamfono.help` serves into its server chunk (§10.5),
# so docs/guide is part of the context while the rest of docs is not. A later pattern wins in
# Docker, so the exception is spelled after the directory it reaches into.
docs
!docs/guide
